# Torvus Bog ok_swamp_hall layer 3: CPlantScarabSwarm placements e0c2d009a and e0c2d0076.
# psc9 launch 2: the layer is loaded, unloaded and loaded again so four constructor calls happen in
# one run (two placements per load), each with its own phase.  The player is kept far away and both
# swarms are deactivated after each load: a phase that leaves a swarm without attack models or
# without the shared model must never let a boid take an attack slot.
@f150 god 1
@f200 tp -60.0 -66.0 -28.0
@f220 layer 3
@f260 send e0c2d009a Deactivate; send e0c2d0076 Deactivate
@f400 layer off 3
@f430 layer 3
@f470 send e0c2d009a Deactivate; send e0c2d0076 Deactivate
@f600 obj e0c2d009a; obj e0c2d0076
@f900 obj e0c2d009a; obj e0c2d0076
@f1190 obj e0c2d009a; obj e0c2d0076
